// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// A ring of the dead laid round a staff, grave sigils between them: step on
// any cell of the ring and every body of it stands up at once, by `Rise`.
(
    name: "The Bone Circle",
    ground: "hall floor",
    turn: Quarter,
    mirror: Both,
    rows: [
        "%:%",
        ":S:",
        "%:%",
    ],
    legend: {
        '%': Prop("circle bones"),
        ':': Prop("grave sigil"),
        'S': Item(tag: "staff", count: 1, band: 1),
    },
)
